# NOTE: the brand webfonts ARE committed. This repository is PRIVATE, which is
# what makes that acceptable — the binaries are not published to anyone outside
# it. Chantal (Device Fonts / Rian Hughes) and Avenir LT Pro (Monotype) are both
# "Preview & Print" embedding only, so if this repo is ever made public again the
# two .woff2 files under public/fonts/ must come back out first. See FONTS.md.

# Client source material: unreleased brand guidelines, packaging artwork and the
# raw 3D masters. The derived assets the site actually serves — logo, labels,
# optimised bottle models — are committed under public/.
brand-source/

# Master footage — the compressed derivatives in public/videos are what ships.
video-source/
